    {
      "id": "en_us-03",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/03-id1567-8598451362355444056.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "0fa327ea3a2ee2f24ecc8f168edbe6d058283f19dae2148bcf70804f6f6bc4fe",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 6900,
      "audioBytes": 441658,
      "reference": "The largest tournament of the year takes place in December at the polo fields in Las Cañitas.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-04",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/04-id1569-6261800542187882882.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "3d8ddfba77c98faafb92bd3cefe2760949521627395da35259a2b0664ec418e7",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 7740,
      "audioBytes": 495418,
      "reference": "The Report opens with plea for open debate and the formation of a consensus in the United States about the policy towards the Middle East.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-05",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/05-id1571-17605417583330616175.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "417fee0dad20562352aa591b6ed5b1f10752eba60ef2d9f95389e8ba34272191",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 6840,
      "audioBytes": 437818,
      "reference": "The Arabs also brought Islam to the lands, and it took in a big way in the Comoros and Mayotte.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-06",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/06-id1583-10493474598526206030.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "e1a0d114c4a7be8f01b945397134aa6061abfefee27d06b53f8178baf1248dc5",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 17540,
      "audioBytes": 1122618,
      "reference": "She came to this conclusion due to the multitude of positive comments and encouragement sent to her by both female and male individuals urging that contraception medication be considered a medical necessity.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-07",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/07-id1603-2487832766827175700.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "802d85c39741ed508ea6edc51eec0a41826fdf15f9d713d44614731ad6595c5b",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 10320,
      "audioBytes": 660538,
      "reference": "Air accidents are common in Iran, which has an aging fleet that is poorly maintained both for civil and military operations.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-08",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/08-id1609-3165540733904730243.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "347228b0381efa21d8cb445be239ec3c7073b71af53ea4fb35d9112be2ddb430",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 10000,
      "audioBytes": 640058,
      "reference": "Robin Uthappa made the innings highest score, 70 runs in just 41 balls by hitting 11 fours and 2 sixes.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-09",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/09-id1627-5570899521134143454.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "927c771e8c06fe6217c6abc2b094c4195568ac41e05145e411d3d0a061c6fdcc",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 10680,
      "audioBytes": 683578,
      "reference": "Ancient Roman meals couldn't have included foods that came to Europe from America or from Asia in later centuries.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-10",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/10-id1630-8259791173436815888.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "e85aef051308d5afd533ce01d5c94baea3d9b785b0d0c57e64e3c183e1556b30",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 8640,
      "audioBytes": 553018,
      "reference": "Arly Velasquez of Mexico finished fifteenth in the men's sitting Super-G. New Zealand's Adam Hall finished ninth in the men's standing Super-G.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-11",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/11-id1636-1994306573920339783.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "24c7a270684158bce7990aa97de9f9c2b3a996752a24b4ee973b7ea85dda7090",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 5400,
      "audioBytes": 345658,
      "reference": "The Spaniards started the colonization period which lasted for three centuries.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "en_us-12",
      "sourceFile": "en_us/12-id1643-2131672871539411072.wav",
      "language": "english",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "a5957dc0ca5f920cefc62c043e1db3bf3eebb7bf63c4ddd727b2a7cec49c40d3",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 12360,
      "audioBytes": 791098,
      "reference": "The park covers 19,500 km² and is divided in 14 different ecozones, each supporting different wildlife.",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-01",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/01-id1545-16654179412893706229.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "fa862f5f1f65b37a25e7f6442517b8b209a965f2447cb169899e518f0a5964bf",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 11340,
      "audioBytes": 725818,
      "reference": "咖喱饭菜既可以是“干”的，也可以是“湿”的，干湿情况取决于水量多少。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-02",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/02-id1550-7303010973263370438.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "a372d82814ace5362a35c762095f371a9496c245173c692b9fa54fbf316f4216",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 9120,
      "audioBytes": 583738,
      "reference": "滑雪是许多滑雪爱好者的主要旅游活动，这些爱好者有时也被称为“滑雪狂人”，他们计划整个假期都在某个地点滑雪。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-03",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/03-id1562-4550421117490119125.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "c1f8d3b9e74686dceb4a75c1219b3ce66d5bd1ca322b1021e54077614262eada",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 5400,
      "audioBytes": 345658,
      "reference": "这成了普遍做法，但铁片会使木制的马车轮子磨损更严重。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
