      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 11560,
      "audioBytes": 739898,
      "reference": "亚马逊河也是地球上最宽的河流，有些河段的宽度可达6英里。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-06",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/06-id1584-15856853901551176967.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "eee36a4e6e40cddeb9c886dcfa9f6e1f234924d319f3ab8bade700e797dd97f9",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 9060,
      "audioBytes": 579898,
      "reference": "据报道，由于执法人员不在场，比什凯克街道上的大规模抢劫持续了一夜。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-07",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/07-id1595-15189979702892055796.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "039f8c152695ced4fc6abc8954c41b9deea2421b9f11f198acfda9fc7e4e9f8a",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 10680,
      "audioBytes": 683578,
      "reference": "藏传佛教以佛陀的教义为基础，但通过大乘佛教的普世之爱和印度瑜伽的许多技巧得到了拓展。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-08",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/08-id1609-6701899574470704768.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
