      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 11520,
      "audioBytes": 737338,
      "reference": "罗宾·乌萨帕 (Robin Uthappa) 取得了本局的最高分，投出了 11 个四分球和 2 个六分球，仅投出 41 个球便赢得 70 分。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cmn_hans_cn-09",
      "sourceFile": "cmn_hans_cn/09-id1616-15231539168705000257.wav",
      "language": "mandarin",
      "sourceClass": "publicHuman",
      "audioSHA256": "aad5dc88eb2301f03f74669f6ef6b1d1290afb565b577aedce0ff6113cf66ed1",
      "audioDurationMilliseconds": 10860,
      "audioBytes": 695098,
      "reference": "如今，科学表明，这种大规模的碳经济，再也无法让过去 200 万年来支持人类进化发展的生物圈保持稳定状态。",
      "protectedExpectations": [],
      "naturalCodeSwitch": false
    },
    {
